# =======================================================================
# Deliberately absent, and why:
#
#   hyprland, hypridle, hyprpaper,   Aquamarine needs a DRM render node; the
#   hyprpolkitagent,                 VM has only /dev/dxg. Replaced by sway,
#   xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland      swaybg and xdg-desktop-portal-wlr.
#   waybar                           waybar/config.jsonc is built on
#                                    hyprland/* modules. sway's own bar is
#                                    configured in sway/config instead.
#   sddm                             No display manager; wsl.sh starts the
#                                    session from a shell.
#   waydroid, waydroid-script-git    Needs binder/ashmem, absent from the
#                                    WSL kernel.
#   vulkan-intel                     No Intel DRM device to drive.
#   mpv, libdvdcss                   VNC carries no audio channel, and there
#                                    is no optical drive.
#   cloudflare-warp-bin              WSL networking is NAT'd through Windows;
#                                    run WARP on the host instead.
# =======================================================================
